msgctxt "104"
msgid "Please... give me some water... so I can take my medicine..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Hey, are you all right!?"
msgstr "Ehi, tutto a posto!?"

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Suddenly... I started having these chest pains... but\r\n"
"I don't have any water to take my medicine... Please\r\n"
"help me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"(This isn't water at all. What I need is some mineral water... that'd do the"
" trick.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "(Never mind.)"
msgstr "Lascia stare."

msgctxt "212"
msgid "(I don't have any water. Maybe I should go buy some.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Water..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"You handed over a bottle of <Color:8>Suntory Mineral Water<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"You handed over a bottle of <Color:8>Okinawaya Mineral Water<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"You handed over a bottle of <Color:8>Famous Local Water<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Here's some water. Drink up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Thank you... I'm saved..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"Whew... You came just in time. That took the pain down\r\n"
"quite a bit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Don't overdo it, old-timer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"Thank you for your concern. It looks like this little fellow\r\n"
"came to my rescue yet again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Meow."
msgstr "Miao."

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"He always brings me someone kind and helpful whenever he sees me in pain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "That's a good companion, all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"He sure is. People are always saying how black cats bring\r\n"
"bad luck, and I can't help but wonder why..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"This little sweetheart's been nothing but a blessing in\r\n"
"disguise... Eheheh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Meow."
msgstr "Miao."

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"Oh, yes. Please take this for all your wonderful help.\r\n"
"Just an old lady's way of saying thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "You got <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>10.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "584"
msgid "I bid you farewell. Come on, little kitty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "(A blessing in disguise, huh? Now that's one lucky cat...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "Please... I need water... To take my medicine..."
msgstr ""

